# Build context hygiene for the house container(s).
#
# The context root is the repo root (Dockerfile lives in containers/
# poste-restante/). Exclude what the image never needs — and crucially,
# the SECRETS (.env.enc / .env.*) and the local-only process docs, so a
# build context can never carry them to a daemon.

.git
node_modules
dist
dist-ssr
*.tsbuildinfo
*.log
*.local

.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Local-only process docs (they carry personal details + machine names)
DEVISING.md
PIPELINE.md
PLAN-*.md
BRIEF-*.md
RECON.md
TASK.md
REVIEW-*.md
.ao-capture/

# Impeccable tooling — not needed by the image
.agents/
.codex/
.opencode/

.DS_Store
